# Fixture bytes are hashed, so they must survive a checkout unchanged. The agent-visible issue
# text comes from upstream with CRLF line endings and its SHA-256 is pinned in the case manifest;
# letting git normalise it would make a fresh clone fail its own integrity check.
evals/fixtures/reusable/*/agent-issue.md -text

# Reports are binary even when their early PDF objects are ASCII-only. Generated
# SQL oracles and captured logs have pinned bytes; do not rewrite line endings.
*.pdf binary
spikes/**/*.log -text
